Exception: the measured film data in Data/spektrafilm/ and the file
Sources/FilmEngine/MeasuredData.swift generated from it are licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (see Data/spektrafilm/SPEKTRAFILM_LICENSE.txt).
Sources/FilmEngine/SkinData.swift contains statistics derived from the NIST Reference Data Set of
Human Skin Reflectance (Cooksey, Allen & Tsai, J. Res. NIST 122, 26, 2017); source: National Institute
of Standards and Technology. NIST data is not subject to copyright protection in the United States.

Sources/FilmEngine/FoliageData.swift contains statistics derived from the USGS Spectral Library Version 7
(Kokaly et al., U.S. Geological Survey Data Series 1035, 2017; doi:10.5066/F7RR1WDJ); source: U.S.
Geological Survey. USGS data is in the public domain.
docs/images/demo-photo.jpg is a CC0 (public domain) photo by Nilo Velez.
